law: carriesOwnTask (TS) == carries_own_task (Rust)
  head slot after CONTINUATION_SCAFFOLD/ARTICLES/PREPS/ONLY_LEAD/COPULAS;
  reset only when that head is a CONTENT token (outside every closed-class
  vocabulary of this law) AND another content token follows it.
  Rationale: this domain's action verbs, shopping/UI nouns, scaffolding and
  anaphora cues are ALL closed class, so a content head is by construction a
  fresh predicate. Noun fragments stay continuations ("the chargers again").
